  1159                                  ;    Exit with:
  1160                                  ;	ES:SI	unchanged
  1161                                  ;	DX	unchanged
  1162                                  ;	memory area is cleared to Zeroes if successful
  1163                                  ;
  1164                                  ;    Error Condition:
  1165                                  ;	*** WILL HALT ***	so have the LITES set up
  1166                                  ;
  1167                                  ;    Trashes:
  1168                                  ;	EAX
  1169                                  ;	BX	is used for the return
  1170                                  ;	CX
  1171                                  ;	DI
  1172                                  ;
